WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.789 --> 00:00:05.890
Speaker 1: Hey, David, 10 percent of the Trump
rioters were military.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:10.310
Doesn't this make Trump's coup fantasy a real
possibility?

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.030
So I think there's a few important things
to talk about here.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:17.110
One is, remember, any time we're talking about
a percentage, we need to know what the base

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:18.510
rate is.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:26.560
The research I've done shows that seven percent
of the population is veterans and just under

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:31.020
half a percent of the population is currently
active duty military.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:38.090
So military is was overrepresented at the
Trump riots, but not dramatically so overrepresented,

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:43.130
but not dramatically so, so active duty and
veterans are seven point four percent of the

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:49.200
population and so far one in 10 defendants
are military.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:55.300
That means that 10 percent instead of seven
point four percent, that's about a 33 percent

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:59.180
overrepresentation of military in the Trump
riot defenders.

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.600
OK, good.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:08.860
Next question, could 10 percent of the military
imagine that 10 percent of the military supported

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.490
a coup for Donald Trump?

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:12.400
It's already the wrong math.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.400
It's already wrong.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:19.310
About 10 percent of those willing to riot
are members of the military.

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:26.230
That does not mean 10 percent of the military
is willing to riot to try to overthrow Joe

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.230
Biden.

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.950
So the numbers don't the numbers don't even
make sense.

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:37.500
But more importantly, because of the military
chain of command, even if 10 percent of the

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:43.119
military was willing, able and interested
to participate in some kind of insurrection

00:01:43.119 --> 00:01:47.280
to reinstall Donald Trump and remove Joe Biden,
it's just not enough.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:48.640
It's just not enough.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:52.280
And it's been made pretty clear, and I know
that there are those who say they're just

00:01:52.280 --> 00:02:00.210
pretending it's pretty clear that military
leadership would not support anything like

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:04.900
what Donald Trump claims to be dreaming up
or what what it is claimed Donald Trump is

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:08.710
dreaming up for August or whenever it's supposed
to be.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:14.499
So I think that there's a concern about, yes,
the overrepresentation of military among the

00:02:14.499 --> 00:02:15.739
rioters.

00:02:15.739 --> 00:02:22.340
There's a concern about law enforcement involvement
as part of the January six riots.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:27.000
There are concerns that we could again see
violence in August when, again, Donald Trump

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.109
doesn't become president of the United States.

00:02:29.109 --> 00:02:30.329
That's all for for sure.

00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:31.879
No doubt about it.

00:02:31.879 --> 00:02:38.680
Do I think that even if 10 percent of the
military wanted the coup, they could make

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.680
it happen?

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:40.680
No, I don't.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:44.549
And remember, it's not 10 percent of the military
are Trump Kurs.

00:02:44.549 --> 00:02:49.180
It's 10 percent of the rioters are current
or former military.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:54.300
So I don't think that this is actually something
that we have to worry about.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.559
I think we have lots to worry about.

00:02:56.559 --> 00:02:59.189
I think there are concerns about will things
get violent?

00:02:59.189 --> 00:03:03.049
I think there are concerns about to what degree
will the Republican Party continue to use

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:09.659
the same rhetoric that propped up the January
6th rioters.

00:03:09.659 --> 00:03:11.129
All of those are concerns.

00:03:11.129 --> 00:03:15.950
What will the most committed Kuhnen Trump
is do when August comes and goes?

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:18.340
And again, Donald Trump is not president of
the United States.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.579
I don't have the answers to that.

00:03:20.579 --> 00:03:25.120
But the military is not going to actually
help Donald Trump achieve this.

